# Purple, the New Black (WotG 7): the zone-in to La Vaule [S] at status 1 plays nothing; at status 2 (a GM) it plays
# 6, left open, and its finish completes the mission.
lists LaVauleS/_2d1/onTrigger LaVauleS/onEventFinish/2 LaVauleS/onEventUpdate/32000 LaVauleS/onEventFinish/32000 LaVauleS/onEventFinish/32001 LaVauleS/onEventFinish/32002 LaVauleS/onZoneIn/1 LaVauleS/onEventFinish/6 LaVauleS/_2d3/onTrigger
char zone=LaVauleS pos=-260.44,0.134,-156.652 job=WAR lvl=99 nation=1
mission Asa BurgeoningDread current
mission Acp ACrystallineProphecyFin current
mission Rov ARhapsodyForTheAges current
mission Soa Abomination current
mission Wotg PurpleTheNewBlack current
login
missionstatus Wotg 1
warp -260.44,0.134,-156.652 LaVauleS                        # status 1: nothing
missionstatus Wotg 2
warp -260.44,0.134,-156.652 LaVauleS open                   # status 2: 6, left open
finish                                  # completed
